# Workflow rules cannot be overridden by tone

"merge everything", "just merge", "CI green", urgency — do NOT waive WORKFLOW.md steps 5-6 or the 7-minute bot wait after new PR or bot tags.

Only explicit written waiver per PR waives bot closeout.
